{%- comment -%}
  Black Friday early bird · the sign-up page, /pages/early-bird · 9 Nov 2026.
  From the design of 9 November, board 2, "Black Friday early bird" (claude.ai
  artifact K5q1nLPkuQgpwScpqs4j23, project/Page.dc.html). Replaces the 6 Nov
  build of pull request 86. Built in the theme's own code; the design file is
  the layout and the words, not pasted in.

  WHAT IS ON IT, top to bottom. Redone 9 Nov 2026 in the cream look of the
  Black Friday emails, on his "use cream use images graphics", from a live
  look at Overtone's early access page and Boom's holiday list page.
  · Kicker, heading, the "From 20 Nov" date stamp (hidden from Fri 20).
  · One big graphic (Overtone: picture, then the form straight under it).
    On a desktop the graphic sits left and the words and form right.
  · The line, the form, the consent line under the button, then the line
    about what happens next.
  · How early access works: three numbered cards, each set at a slight
    angle like Overtone's hand-drawn boxes.
  · A polaroid collage of five graphics on Paper Deep, like Boom's, each
    linking to its wine. Then the theme's own footer.
  · No Wine bands. Wine, Vine and Terra Rossa only as the small number
    circles and the one button.

  THE FORM, his word of 9 Nov 2026: our own form, no Klaviyo form and no
  klaviyo.js, so it works for someone who said no to cookies. On submit it
  posts to Klaviyo's client subscription endpoint, POST
  https://a.klaviyo.com/client/subscriptions?company_id=<public key>,
  revision 2026-10-15 (read in Klaviyo's reference that day). It sends the
  email, email marketing consent SUBSCRIBED, the list (list_id, SSmpAc,
  single opt-in, read live 9 Nov) and custom_source, which Klaviyo stores on
  the consent record. Only the public key (site ID) is in the theme, the
  same one snippets/klaviyo-consent-loader uses; never a private key.
  Klaviyo answers 202 on success: the visitor goes to the thank-you page.
  Anything else: the error line shows and the button comes back.
  The 18 or over tick is required by the browser and by the script. The
  consent line sits in plain sight under the button: joining means the early
  access email and our other emails, his ruling of 9 Nov. The Klaviyo form
  UHxh6W stays as it is, a draft, unused.

  WORDS FROM FRI 20 TO MON 23 NOV: each changing line carries its "open"
  words beside it (snippets/tl-eb-words), shown under html.tl-eb-open,
  which snippets/tl-dates sets inside the early access window. Late joiners
  get their code straight away from Klaviyo. After Mon 23 Nov 23:59 the page
  has no closed state: he takes it down.

  WORDS, from the design and his drafts, his word owed before publish. Never
  on it: a depth, an end date, a gift, a delivery line, £85, "VIP", "sale",
  "deal", "save", a countdown or a stock count. It names Friday 20 November
  because that date is ruled and true.

  GRAPHICS: the bf26- graphics from the Drive folder "insta", cleaned on
  9 Nov 2026, picked in the template as shopify://shop_images/<name>. They
  show once he has uploaded them to Shopify Files under those exact names.
  A picker left empty, or a file not yet uploaded, leaves its place out
  rather than showing a broken picture.

  SEARCH: noindex, nofollow, set in layout/theme.liquid for this template
  and the thank-you template. Kept out of every menu. The newsletter popup
  is off on both templates (sections/newsletter-popup.liquid).

  TESTING ON A COPY: any page shows this template with ?view=early-bird, and
  a sign-up there goes to the same page with ?view=early-bird-thanks.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- render 'tl-eb-style' -%}
{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  assign eb_on_page = false
  if request.page_type == 'page' and page.handle == 'early-bird'
    assign eb_on_page = true
  endif
-%}

<div class="tl-eb-x eb">
  <div class="eb__top">
    <div class="eb__words">
      {%- if s.kicker != blank -%}<p class="eb__kicker">{{ s.kicker }}</p>{%- endif -%}
      <h1 class="eb-h eb__head">
        {%- if s.heading_open != blank -%}
          <span class="eb-pre">{{ s.heading }} <span class="eb-em">{{ s.heading_em }}</span></span><span class="eb-open">{{ s.heading_open }} <span class="eb-em">{{ s.heading_open_em }}</span></span>
        {%- else -%}
          {{ s.heading }} <span class="eb-em">{{ s.heading_em }}</span>
        {%- endif -%}
      </h1>
      {%- if s.stamp_day != blank -%}
        <p class="eb__stamp eb-pre" aria-label="{{ s.stamp_top }} {{ s.stamp_day }} {{ s.stamp_bottom }}">
          <span class="eb__stamp-small">{{ s.stamp_top }}</span>
          <span class="eb__stamp-big">{{ s.stamp_day }}</span>
          <span class="eb__stamp-small">{{ s.stamp_bottom }}</span>
        </p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    {%- if s.hero_image != blank -%}
      <div class="eb__pic">
        {{- s.hero_image | image_url: width: 1400 | image_tag: class: 'eb__pic-img', loading: 'eager', fetchpriority: 'high', widths: '400, 600, 800, 1000, 1400', sizes: '(min-width: 769px) 50vw, 100vw', alt: s.hero_alt -}}
      </div>
    {%- endif -%}

    <div class="eb__join">
      {%- if s.text != blank -%}
        <p class="eb__text">{% render 'tl-eb-words', pre: s.text, open: s.text_open %}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      <div class="eb__form-wrap" id="EarlyBirdForm">
        <form class="eb__form" data-eb-form novalidate
          data-key="{{ s.public_key | escape }}"
          data-list="{{ s.list_id | escape }}"
          data-source="{{ s.custom_source | escape }}"
          data-thanks="{{ s.thanks_path | escape }}"
          data-on-page="{{ eb_on_page }}">
          <label class="eb__label text-label" for="EbEmail-{{ section.id }}">{{ s.email_label }}</label>
          <input class="eb__input" type="email" id="EbEmail-{{ section.id }}" name="email" required
            autocomplete="email" autocapitalize="off" autocorrect="off" spellcheck="false" inputmode="email"
            placeholder="{{ s.email_placeholder | escape }}">
          <label class="eb__tick text-label">
            <input type="checkbox" name="age" required>
            <span>{{ s.age_label }}</span>
          </label>
          <button type="submit" class="eb-btn eb-btn--solid eb__btn" data-eb-submit>{{ s.button_label }}</button>
          <p class="eb__error" data-eb-error role="alert" hidden>{{ s.error_text }}</p>
          {%- if s.consent_line != blank -%}
            <p class="eb__consent">{{ s.consent_line }}</p>
          {%- endif -%}
        </form>
        {%- if s.under_button != blank -%}
          <p class="eb__under">{% render 'tl-eb-words', pre: s.under_button, open: s.under_button_open %}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="eb__how">
    {%- if s.how_heading != blank -%}
      <h2 class="eb-h eb__how-head">{{ s.how_heading }}</h2>
    {%- endif -%}
    <ol class="eb__steps">
      {%- for key in (1..3) -%}
        {%- assign tk = 'step_' | append: key | append: '_title' -%}
        {%- assign bk = 'step_' | append: key | append: '_text' -%}
        {%- assign tko = tk | append: '_open' -%}
        {%- assign bko = bk | append: '_open' -%}
        {%- if s[tk] != blank -%}
          <li class="eb__step eb__step--{{ key }}">
            <span class="eb__num" aria-hidden="true">{{ key }}</span>
            <h3 class="eb__step-title">{% render 'tl-eb-words', pre: s[tk], open: s[tko] %}</h3>
            <p class="eb__step-text">{% render 'tl-eb-words', pre: s[bk], open: s[bko] %}</p>
          </li>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
    </ol>
  </div>

  {%- render 'tl-eb-polaroids', s: s, heading: s.collage_heading -%}
</div>

<script>
  (function () {
    var form = document.querySelector('[data-eb-form]:not([data-eb-ready])');
    if (!form) return;
    form.setAttribute('data-eb-ready', '');
    var email = form.querySelector('input[name="email"]');
    var age = form.querySelector('input[name="age"]');
    var btn = form.querySelector('[data-eb-submit]');
    var err = form.querySelector('[data-eb-error]');
    function thanksUrl() {
      if (form.getAttribute('data-on-page') === 'true') return form.getAttribute('data-thanks');
      var u = new URL(window.location.href);
      u.searchParams.set('view', 'early-bird-thanks');
      return u.pathname + u.search;
    }
    function fail() { err.hidden = false; btn.disabled = false; btn.removeAttribute('aria-busy'); }
    form.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {
      e.preventDefault();
      err.hidden = true;
      if (!form.reportValidity()) return;
      if (!age.checked) { age.focus(); return; }
      btn.disabled = true;
      btn.setAttribute('aria-busy', 'true');
      var body = {
        data: {
          type: 'subscription',
          attributes: {
            custom_source: form.getAttribute('data-source'),
            profile: { data: { type: 'profile', attributes: {
              email: email.value.trim(),
              subscriptions: { email: { marketing: { consent: 'SUBSCRIBED' } } }
            } } }
          },
          relationships: { list: { data: { type: 'list', id: form.getAttribute('data-list') } } }
        }
      };
      fetch('https://a.klaviyo.com/client/subscriptions?company_id=' + encodeURIComponent(form.getAttribute('data-key')), {
        method: 'POST',
        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/vnd.api+json', 'Accept': 'application/vnd.api+json', 'revision': '2026-10-15' },
        body: JSON.stringify(body)
      }).then(function (r) {
        if (r.ok) { window.location.href = thanksUrl(); } else { fail(); }
      }).catch(fail);
    });
  })();
</script>

{%- style -%}
  .eb { background: var(--eb-paper); }
  .eb__top { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); grid-template-areas: "words" "pic" "join"; }
  .eb__words { grid-area: words; padding: 36px 24px 24px; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 18px; }
  .eb__pic { grid-area: pic; padding: 0 16px; }
  .eb__pic-img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .eb__join { grid-area: join; padding: 28px 24px 40px; max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto; box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; }
  .eb__kicker { margin: 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.2em !important; text-transform: uppercase !important; }
  .eb__head { font-size: 40px; line-height: 1.08; font-weight: 400; }
  .eb__stamp { margin: 0; width: 88px; height: 88px; border: 1px solid var(--eb-ink); border-radius: 50%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; line-height: 1; }
  html.tl-eb-open .tl-eb-x .eb__stamp { display: none; }
  .eb__stamp-small { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .eb__stamp-big { font-family: var(--eb-head); font-size: 30px; margin: 3px 0; }
  .eb__text { margin: 0 0 22px; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6; text-align: center; }
  .eb__form-wrap { margin: 0; }
  .eb__form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; margin: 0; }
  .tl-eb-x .eb__label { display: block; margin: 0; font-family: var(--eb-body); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0; text-transform: none; color: var(--eb-ink); }
  .tl-eb-x .eb__input { width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; min-height: 52px; margin: 0; padding: 14px; font: inherit; font-size: 16px; color: var(--eb-ink); background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--eb-stone); border-radius: 0; }
  .tl-eb-x .eb__input:focus { outline: 2px solid var(--eb-ink); outline-offset: 1px; border-color: var(--eb-ink); }
  .tl-eb-x .eb__tick { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; margin: 0; font-family: var(--eb-body); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0; text-transform: none; cursor: pointer; color: var(--eb-ink); }
  .tl-eb-x .eb__tick input { flex: 0 0 auto; width: 22px; height: 22px; margin: 0; accent-color: var(--eb-ink); }
  .eb__btn { margin-top: 4px; cursor: pointer; }
  .eb__btn[disabled] { opacity: 0.7; cursor: progress; }
  .eb__error { margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--eb-terra); font-weight: 500; }
  .eb__consent { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; text-align: center; color: var(--eb-ink); }
  .eb__under { margin: 16px 0 0; text-align: center; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .eb__how { background: var(--eb-paper-deep); padding: 48px 24px 56px; }
  .tl-eb-x .eb__how-head { font-size: 32px; line-height: 1.15; font-weight: 400; text-align: center; margin: 0 0 44px; }
  .eb__steps { list-style: none; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 40px; max-width: 520px; }
  .eb__step { position: relative; margin: 0; border: 1.5px solid var(--eb-ink); background: var(--eb-paper); padding: 34px 22px 24px; transform: rotate(-0.6deg); }
  .eb__step--2 { transform: rotate(0.7deg); }
  .eb__step--3 { transform: rotate(-0.4deg); }
  .eb__num { position: absolute; top: -22px; left: 18px; width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%; border: 1.5px solid var(--eb-ink); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: var(--eb-head); font-size: 20px; color: #FFFFFF; background: var(--eb-wine); }
  .eb__step--2 .eb__num { background: var(--eb-vine); }
  .eb__step--3 .eb__num { background: var(--eb-terra); }
  .eb__step-title { margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: var(--eb-body); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.4; letter-spacing: 0.14em !important; text-transform: uppercase !important; }
  .eb__step-text { margin: 0; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; }
  @media (min-width: 769px) {
    .eb__top { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); grid-template-areas: "pic words" "pic join"; grid-template-rows: auto 1fr; max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 56px 32px 72px; column-gap: 56px; }
    .eb__pic { padding: 0; align-self: start; }
    .eb__words { padding: 24px 0 0; }
    .eb__join { padding: 24px 0 0; }
    .eb__head { font-size: 60px; }
    .tl-eb-x .eb__btn { width: 100%; }
    .eb__how { padding: 80px 32px 88px; }
    .tl-eb-x .eb__how-head { font-size: 44px; margin-bottom: 56px; }
    .eb__steps { flex-direction: row; max-width: 1120px; gap: 28px; }
    .eb__step { flex: 1 1 0; }
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

